"wykonuje I<polecenie> przesyłając mu I<argumenty>, i zwraca jego kod "
"zakończenia."

#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed debian-unstable
msgid ""
"If the B<EXE> variable is not defined for some reason, the first version of "
"the linker command could end up deleting one of the object files (the first "
