"nop=suffix-nop> generates CW<\\*(C`call foo 0x90\\*(C'>.  \\&B<call-"
"nop=prefix->I<byte> generates CW<\\*(C`>\\f(CIbyteCW< call foo\\*(C'>.  "
"\\&B<call-nop=suffix->I<byte> generates CW<\\*(C`call foo "
