"used any number of times."
msgstr ""

#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed debian-unstable
msgid ""
"This option is used to augment the current linker script with additional "
"mapping of input sections to output sections.  This file must use the same "
"syntax for CW<\\*(C`SECTIONS\\*(C'> as is used in normal linker scripts, but "
